          "copies/gf569df0451.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "stamped, not written. The slug's fixed heavy mark stands before the figures; the figures alone give a possible date, so it is not counted as a digit. Third figure over-inked but its flat base and diagonal match the plain 2 beside it. Roll number 361 is written in pencil in e4 and printed on the tab label in e6 (Welte-Mignon No. 361, Schumann, Fantasia op. 17, C major, Part I)."
        }
       ]
      }
